# Installed as /etc/tmpfiles.d/faramir.conf.  {{.RunDir}} holds the three
# activation sockets plus the ssh-agent socket the broker creates.  A sudo
# grant adds nothing here: it binds no socket and holds no file.
#
# Created here rather than by RuntimeDirectory= on a service: systemd chowns a
# RuntimeDirectory recursively when its owner does not match the unit's User=,
# rewriting the SocketUser= and SocketGroup= of every socket inside it.
#
# Owned by the broker, the only uid that creates anything here.  0755 so the
# other uids can traverse to the sockets, whose own modes decide who connects.
d {{.RunDir}} 0755 {{.BrokerUser}} {{.BrokerGroup}} -
